// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// patch.tjs -- engine startup patch, loaded by TVPExecuteStartupScript()
// (src/core/base/ScriptMgnIntf.cpp) from "<app path>/patch.tjs", i.e. from the
// directory that holds the game archive, before startup.tjs is executed.
//
// This is the same slot the patch library's patch.tjs occupies.  For this
// fixture it only has to be observable: the interesting work (registering the
// XP3 decode filter) is done by the sibling xp3filter.tjs, which the
// xp3filter plugin loads on its own.
//
// Note this file is *not* inside the archive: when an archive is passed on the
// command line, the app path is the directory containing it (the engine's
// TVPProjectDir is the archive path, and TVPGetAppPath() -> TVPExtractStoragePath()
// of that yields the archive's directory).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Debug.message("patch: patch.tjs executed; startup storage = "
	+ Storages.getPlacedPath("startup.tjs"));
